  "gaps": "Ring road reads as a plain circle with radial slabs, not the real oval loop; avenue trees only partial; cathedral is a gabled nave rather than barrel-vaulted with transepts; hotel and backdrop blocks are plain boxes without balconies; green verandah building simplified; City Hall lacks loggia detail; ground is flat grass (real site is paved asphalt)"
